{"metadata":{"title":"Getting Started with OUDS","role":"article","images":[{"identifier":"ic_unified_ds.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_unified_ds.png","type":"card"}],"modules":[{"name":"Welcome to Orange Unified Design System"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How to add the package as dependency, import libraries and use theme and components for your apps."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/GettingStarted"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/gettingstarted"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Integrate OUDS","anchor":"Integrate-OUDS","level":2},{"type":"heading","text":"Use Swift Package Manager","anchor":"Use-Swift-Package-Manager","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to add the iOS library of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Unified Design System","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", you need to add our ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Package","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" into your project.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do that, add a new ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"package dependency","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" to your ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" project by refering to it by ","type":"text"},{"code":"github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You are free to choose whether or not you want a branch or a specific tag, pick the solution you want.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds","type":"reference"},{"text":" for more details about versions, releases and tags. You can find release tags (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") and release candidates tags (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0-rc3","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Import the librairies you need","anchor":"Import-the-librairies-you-need","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You should use one (or several) of the following imports for your needs, which are basically ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Package","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" products.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"We recommend to embed in your apps only the ones you need to avoid to embed useless assets.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"tip","name":"Tip"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import OUDSThemesContract \/\/ If you want to define your theme, use themes or OUDSThemeableView","import OUDSModules \/\/ To use modules","import OUDSComponents \/\/ To use components","import OUDSThemesOrange \/\/ To use the default Orange theme","import OUDSThemesOrangeCompact \/\/ To use the Orange Compact theme","import OUDSThemesSosh \/\/ To use the Sosh theme","import OUDSThemesWireframe \/\/ To use the Wireframe theme","import OUDSTokensComponent \/\/ If you need to override or use directly components tokens","import OUDSTokenSemantic \/\/ If you need to override or use directly semantic tokens","import OUDSTokensRaw \/\/ If you need to override or use directly raw tokens","import OUDSFoundations \/\/ For some utilities"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Or more simple, import umbrella library","anchor":"Or-more-simple-import-umbrella-library","level":3},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"We do not recommend this solution because from our point of view use of tailored imports is better to import only the needed elements.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use of umbrella products can increase app sizes and needed storage because it emebds plenty of assets (images, fonts, etc.)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and useless constants.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"Note"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Import the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Package","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" product which suits your needs:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Umbrella","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUI"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All librairies listed above and all themes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUIOrange","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All librairies listed above but with only Orange and Orange Compact themes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUIWireframe","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All librairies listed above but with only Wireframe theme","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUIOrangeSosh","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All librairies listed above but with only Orange and Sosh themes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row"},{"type":"heading","text":"Chose your theme","anchor":"Chose-your-theme","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Unified Design System","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" framework provides today four themes:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Theme","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default one for Orange products and can be enriched \/ derivated","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Compact","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For some Orange products with heavy \/ rich UI and dimensions constraints","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Sosh","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For Sosh products","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Wireframe","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For mockups, prototypes and prooves of concepts witouth Orange-flavoured styles","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row"},{"type":"heading","text":"Apply a theme","anchor":"Apply-a-theme","level":3},{"type":"row","columns":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You will need to use for your application root view the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/oudsthemeableview\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/themes","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" also."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This special view is here to define some elements as environment variables and injects the choosen theme."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"size":1},{"content":[{"code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","       WindowGroup {","          OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","          }","       }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"size":1}],"numberOfColumns":2},{"type":"row","columns":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Then get the current applied theme in your views and use the tokens you want.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The tokens are wrapped in providers with clear names, you only need to choose the ones you want."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"size":1},{"content":[{"code":["\/\/ Use it in views as an environment variable","@Environment(\\.theme) var theme"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"size":1}],"numberOfColumns":2},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Keep in mind only one theme can be used within one ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"tip","name":"Tip"},{"type":"heading","text":"Trick for Xcode Preview","anchor":"Trick-for-Xcode-Preview","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you use Xcode ","type":"text"},{"code":"#Preview","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" blocks, you will have to be sure the theme is instanciated and injected through the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because it is not possible today to override the legit ","type":"text"},{"code":"#Preview","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block, you can instead use some of our utilities to wrap your content","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inside the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" automatically. These utilities come with the themes modules. Without them you may face errors about undefined theme.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Apply Orange theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .orangePreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Orange Compact theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .orangeCompactPreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Sosh theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .soshPreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Wireframe theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .wireframePreview()","}"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Tokens","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Themes","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Components","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Modules"],"anchor":"Essentials"}],"kind":"article","references":{"https://ios.unified-design-system.orange.com/documentation/ouds/oudsthemeableview/":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/oudsthemeableview\/","title":"OUDSThemeableView","url":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/oudsthemeableview\/","type":"link"},"ic_component_intro.png":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/ic_component_intro.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":null,"identifier":"ic_component_intro.png","type":"image"},"https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/ouds-ios/wiki/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"refer to the wiki"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds","title":"refer to the wiki","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds","type":"link"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/Tokens":{"role":"article","images":[{"identifier":"ic_design_token_intro.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_design_token_intro.png","type":"card"}],"kind":"article","title":"T